                                                "example_id": "e5cc7461-3341-4454-a75f-97ab803c9c14",
                                                "sense_id": "34c26ba0-268c-3567-9bce-43b0408cd9a9",
                                                "text": "Furthermore, the thermophilic formation of magnetic iron oxides was prevented by the ferric reductase inhibitor p-chloromercuriphenyl sulfonate (pCMPS), the hydrogenase inhibitor quinacrine dihydrochloride, the protonophore carbonyl cyanide m-chlorophenylhydrazone (CCCP), and the electron transport inhibitors 2-n-heptyl-4-hydroxyquinoline-N-oxide (HOQNO) and dicumarol."
                                            }
